2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/MYYQ-RYB
2 CONT '''Brief Life History of Gerd Bergljot Tønnesen (Knobel)'''
2 CONT When Gerd Bergljot Knobel was born on 30 September 1895, in Sarpsborg, Østfold, Norway, her father, Abraham Knobel, was 33, and her mother, Louise Wilhelmine Josefine Bergmann, was 28. She married Martin Emanuel Lundgren Tønnesen 
2 CONC on 2 April 1916, in Tune, Sarpsborg, Østfold, Norway. They were the parents of at least 2 sons. She lived in Sarpsborg, Smaalenenes, Norway in 1900. She died on 5 January 1970, at the age of 74.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Marriage on 2 Apr 1916 in Tune, Sarpsborg, Østfold, Norway between
2 CONT '''Martin Emanuel Lundgren Tønnesen''' Male 1883–1925 GJDB-JKL and '''Gerd Bergljot Knobel''' Female 1895–1970 MYYQ-RYB
2 CONT Children (2)
2 CONT # Finn Knobel Tonnessen Male 1917–1985 GJDB-TP5
2 CONT # Knut Lundgren Male 1921–Deceased GJD1-HDZ
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Marriage on 15 Nov 1930 in Sarpsborg, Østfold, Norway between
2 CONT '''Gunnar Johannesen Roen''' Male 1900–Deceased LK9R-DWW and Gerd Bergljot Knobel Female 1895–1970 MYYQ-RYB
2 CONT Children (0)
