2 CONT
2 CONT Gravstenen uppsatt 1914 och finns bevarad har texten Olaf P[edersen] Stevenson 1878 1913. Födelseårtalet fel skall vara 1877.
2 CONT
2 CONT STEVENSON, Olaf P., Death: 6-June-1913, Plot E, Row 4, Grave 29, A 35 year old married American man born in Bergen, Norway and from Brooklyn, New York, working for the First Division, Isthmus Canal Company for nine months and livi
2 CONC ng at Empire, Canal Zone. He died on June 6, 1913 at the Pedro Miguel Locks. He was buried at the Ancon Cemetery. He was disinterred and cremated in March 1914 and buried at the Corozal American Cemetery.
2 CONT Gravstensuppgifter
2 CONT buried at the Ancon Cemetery
2 CONT disinterred and cremated in March 1914 and buried at the Corozal American Cemetery.
