2 CONT '''Brief Life History of Abraham Knobel'''
2 CONT When Abraham Knobel was born on 27 November 1861, in Sarpsborg, Smaalenenes, Norway, his father, Johannes Knobel, was 23 and his mother, Annette Vilhelmine Helgesdatter, was 28. He married Louise Wilhelmine Josefine Bergmann on 27
2 CONC  December 1886, in Moss, Østfold, Norway. They were the parents of at least 7 sons and 5 daughters. He died on 22 July 1939, in Haugen, Aust-Agder, Norway, at the age of 77.
