2 CONT '''Brief Life History of Louise Wilhelmine Josefine Knobel (Bergmann)'''
2 CONT When Louise Wilhelmine Josefine Bergmann was born on 24 September 1867, in Moss, Østfold, Norway, her father, August Frederik Ludvig Dietrick Bergman, was 33, and her mother, Anette Mathea Hofslund, was 25. She married Abraham Kno
2 CONC bel on 27 December 1886, in Moss, Østfold, Norway. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 4 daughters. She lived in Sarpsborg, Smaalenenes, Norway in 1900. She died on 17 December 1919, at the age of 52, and was buried in Tu
2 CONC ne, Østfold, Norway.
2 CONT
