1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/MYYQ-RLC
2 CONT '''Brief Life History of David Knobel'''
2 CONT When David Knobel was born on 27 December 1868, in Sarpsborg, Østfold, Norway, his father, Johannes Knobel, was 30 and his mother, Annette Vilhelmine Helgesdatter, was 35. He married Halldis Brandt-Rantzau in March 1893. They were
2 CONC  the parents of at least 1 son and 4 daughters. He lived in Tune, Østfold, Norway in 1900.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage in Mar 1893 between
2 CONT '''David Knobel''' Male 1868–Deceased MYYQ-RLC and '''Halldis Brandt-Rantzau''' Female 1872–Deceased K461-2QM
