1 NAME Carl Wilhelm Andreas /Falck/
2 GIVN Carl Wilhelm Andreas
2 SURN Falck
2 _MARNM Falck
2 NICK Calle Falck
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 27 MAY 1907
2 ADDR
3 CITY Tønsberg
3 STAE Vestfold
